'' The spilled module on stdout: the head is written before the body that was spilled, and
'' holds the declarations the body's calls need -- llvm.sqrt and llvm.floor from Root and
'' Floored, libm's tan from Tangent, each emitted into its own chunk.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --emit-ir -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/ir-spill.bas
'' ENV: TKO_IR_SPILL=1
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT-SEQ: target triple
'' EXPECT-OUT-SEQ: declare double @llvm.sqrt.double(double) nounwind
'' EXPECT-OUT: declare double @"tan"(double) nounwind
'' EXPECT-OUT-SEQ: define
